// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Competition canonical domain entity.
//
// Competition is a first-class canonical entity independent of any single
// provider. It can be reused by Teams, Matchcenter, Website, Infoboard,
// Results, Standings, Statistics, and future federation providers.
//
// Architecture invariants:
//   - Provider-neutral: the `provider` field distinguishes origin (e.g. "SFV").
//   - Tenant-scoped: all lookups and mutations must include tenantId.
//   - Idempotent upsert keyed on (tenantId, provider, externalCompetitionId,
//     externalSeasonId) prevents duplicates across sync runs.
//   - No standings, results, rankings, or scheduling data live here.
//     Competition represents only competition metadata.
//   - isArchived = true means the competition is hidden from active workflows
//     but is retained for historical references.
//   - lastSyncedAt is set by the sync service on every successful run.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

