//
// TEAM-CREATE-02: Introduced to replace ad-hoc category-based classification
// for new business logic. Decoupled from the legacy TeamCategory field and
// from any provider-specific concepts.
//
// Values:
//   COMPETITION   — Team participates in a formal competition (league, cup, etc.)
//   TRAINING      — Training group; no competitive participation.
//   DEVELOPMENT   — Youth / development group; structured but non-competitive.
//   RECREATIONAL  — Recreational / leisure group (e.g. Walking Football).
//   OTHER         — Catch-all for future or atypical participation forms.
//
// Localisation: labels are defined in the UI layer (German).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
